  "Not enough Devnet SOL for setup. Request more at faucet.solana.com (setup needs about 0.02 SOL).": "Seadistuseks pole piisavalt Devnet SOL-i. Küsige juurde aadressilt faucet.solana.com (seadistus vajab umbes 0.02 SOL-i).",
