  "— all three steps executed successfully.": "— kõik kolm sammu tehti edukalt.",
  "FAILED AND COMPENSATED": "EBAÕNNESTUS JA KOMPENSEERITI",
  "— a step failed; every completed step was compensated by a real on-chain transaction, in reverse order. The final state matches the starting state. The transaction history does not disappear, and it should not: it is the audit trail.": "— samm ebaõnnestus; iga lõpetatud samm kompenseeriti päris ahelasisese tehinguga vastupidises järjekorras. Lõppolek vastab algolekule. Tehingute ajalugu ei kao ega peagi kaduma: see on auditijälg.",
