  "PAY": "MAKSA",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Looge maksekorraldus kolmes sammus: valige teenus ja summa, valige makseviis ning saate täpsed makseandmed koos tellimuse numbriga.",
  "01 — SERVICE & AMOUNT": "01 — TEENUS JA SUMMA",
