  "Project amount": "Projekti summa",
  "Currency": "Valuuta",
  "Deposit and milestone percentages are set in your written agreement — use the split that matches your quote.": "Ettemaksu ja verstapostide protsendid on määratud teie kirjalikus lepingus — kasutage pakkumisele vastavat jaotust.",
  "Customer service (optional)": "Klienditeenindus (valikuline)",
  "If one of our customer service staff assisted you, type their name here so we can credit them.": "Kui keegi meie klienditeenindusest teid aitas, kirjutage siia tema nimi, et saaksime selle talle arvestada.",
