  "Interac e-Transfer is available in CAD only. Switch the currency to CAD to use it.": "Interac e-Transfer on saadaval ainult CAD-is. Selle kasutamiseks muutke valuutaks CAD.",
  "03 — GENERATE ORDER": "03 — LOO TELLIMUS",
  "GENERATE ORDER →": "LOO TELLIMUS →",
  "Enter an amount above zero and choose a payment method first.": "Sisestage esmalt nullist suurem summa ja valige makseviis.",
